{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:22 2026-10-28 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:22 2026-10-28 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:22 2026-10-28 HKT</p><p>MIRROR成員陳卓賢（Ian）到沙田出席美妝活動，吸引數以百計粉絲「Hellosss」到場應援，同場還有黃淑蔓。</p><h2>陳卓賢研究時表情多多</h2><p>Ian以一身白馬王子Look早早便抵達場地拍攝，面對粉絲熱情，Ian不時報以微笑及揮手回應，引起陣陣尖叫聲，雖然早早便進入工作模式，不過Ian非常精靈，與工作人員研究拍攝細節時依然表情多多，更向粉絲鏡頭比V，相當寵粉。而黃淑蔓則以一身白裙現身，與Ian合作拍攝有互動，甚為合襯。</p><img alt=\"MIRROR成員陳卓賢（Ian）到沙田出席美妝活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/6039872c0af1310597f4d165a1d87008/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_23_16.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"研究拍攝效果。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/086aa5b88d2bf5a183afa0cec4d32972/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_23_17_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"Ian以一身白馬王子Look早早便抵達場地拍攝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/1048a34ac47d55d86bc1730422c46f06/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_23_17_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"吸引數以百計粉絲「Hellosss」到場應援。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/c38345fba4f0d28dc17297d5b616f638/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_23_18_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"不時同粉絲打招呼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/751a9889dee08461370a5fe6b44e8171/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_23_18_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"表情多多。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/4ab114ed6dd2c34d8141548a0c2b60be/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_23_18_3_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"Ian非常精靈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/c80942a1fd37730d20fd06b5abbf2115/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_23_18.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"早早便進入工作模式。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/1597cf776ddaed0774d53680716c5c9d/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_23_19_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"非常投入。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/83c501f09b6becb0705096617b6539d4/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_23_19_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"Ian不時報以微笑及揮手回應。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/dfd9b4a3dde0b23bc9acf18e101ec103/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_23_19.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"與工作人員研究拍攝細節。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/3d4f67c060e13d6a4aab0d28aa88a151/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_23_20_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"去另一個場景。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/9945e07c1025f63d556fdcb0cd3a9723/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_23_20_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"更向粉絲鏡頭比V，相當寵粉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/37957aec2bc7e0a1f92c9d165ac56902/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_23_20.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"Ian動作多多。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/54f6fa3f62abc33c265f7db50c4752cf/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_23_21_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"同場還有黃淑蔓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/96d50f5b2381a035cf069c720d19aeb6/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_23_21_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"與Ian合作拍攝有互動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/a846f8f4b98e814380a2bdef09e1957a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_23_21_3_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"白馬王子Look。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/f8feba8b2dc53b42e2d46ff4a799ad48/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_23_22_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"黃淑蔓則以一身白裙現身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/e2c47da7b648ea0f3b38c6ef4a91988f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_23_22_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"黃淑蔓則以一身白裙現身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/69e7ccabb9ee2c53ed9f0113b45c39dc/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_23_22_3_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"二人甚為合襯。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/d3f08790d271aabd1001f3448004fde2/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_23_22.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"跟粉絲打招呼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/566f54ce74d9f371411cf520b6582f31/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_23_23_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"擺甫士影相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/d7705ac559c51728308919cdcf723914/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_23_23_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"二人分享感受。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/84dd4ca65cc5d9737821500127df64cc/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-28_at_13_23_24_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T07:42:59.293656+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":291,"images":23,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T07:22:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T09:19:14.501411+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T07:38:40.227699+00:00","content_hash":"d4a74ee64323fa3cb2395439ccc16f3d3c93be44a689e331afff7196cedac324","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}